# Stage-2 exclusions for the .NET core — applied via --ignore-file-override (generation
# config, not hand-editing; ADR-SDK-023). Patterns are relative to languages/dotnet/core/.
# NOTE: this generator build's matcher is narrower than gitignore — bare names and root
# globs do not match; every rule needs a `**/` prefix (verified by dry-run, 2026-07-15).

# Opt-in Polly retry/timeout/circuit-breaker helper extensions: the core's public surface
# must not even offer retry machinery (failover-contract §5; bake-off §A5).
**/IHttpClientBuilderExtensions.cs

# Test scaffolding — product tests are hand-written under languages/dotnet/tests/.
**/*.Test/**

# Solution scaffolding: the language-level solution (core + runtime + tests) is a stage-3
# deliverable; the core ships its csproj only.
**/*.sln

# A committed spec copy would sidestep the single-pin rule (ADR-SDK-006; spec/pin.yaml).
**/api/openapi.yaml

# Standalone-repo/CI scaffolding — meaningless inside the monorepo (ADR-SDK-016).
**/appveyor.yml
**/git_push.*
